<title>MALAYSIA: India's STC tenders for 12,000t RBD palm olein.</title>
<headline>India's STC tenders for 12,000t RBD palm olein.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's STC is tendering on Tuesday for 12,000 tonnes of RBD palm olein in two shipments of 6,000 tonnes each, traders said confirming an earlier report.</p>
<p>The first shipment of 6,000 tonnes is for first-half October shipment and the second for last-half November shipment, they said. STC in New Delhi declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom, 603-230-8911</p>
</text>
